            is “trace class” in the non-standard sense described above in that it makes the above diagram commute.
          %p
            So everything as known from standard
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+mechanics"} quantum mechanics
            textbooks, except that we don’t use the full
