            of states, but just the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frechet+space"} Frechet space
            of smooth functions.
          %h2#explicit_description_of__2
            explicit description of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
